<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Altera raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Altera raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co raised its rating on shares of Altera Corp to buy from long-term attractive based on improving inventory conditions and order growth.</p>
<p>-- In addition, the company raised Altera's 1996 earnings estimate to $2.25 from $2.20 and 1997 to $2.50 from $2.38.</p>
<p>-- Late Wednesday, Altera reported third quarter primary share earnings of $0.53 on revenue of $116.7 million versus $0.52 a share on $109 million one year ago.</p>
</text>
